# name: test_web_with_docker
  '''
  # Claude Code session start hook — OK
  
  **Environment:** firecracker sandbox (direct internet via transparent proxy)
  
  running, `DOCKER_HOST=unix:///var/run/docker.sock`
  - `docker run` works. `docker build --network=host` works (BuildKit handles large output gracefully).
    Details: <devinfra/claude/docs/docker_evaluation_results.md>
    Use `--network=host` for builds; Alpine apk may need `--no-check-certificate` for TLS proxy.
  - Storage: overlay on tmpfs (layer caching works for <~35 layers). Use `--layers=false` for larger Dockerfiles.
  
